###
### NooblyJS Core - Knowledge Service API (feature 05)
###
### Ask questions of the documents in a filing source and get cited answers.
### app.js mounts the service with the app's filing root as the source.
### Every request needs an API key (or a signed-in session / personal access token).
###

@baseUrl = http://localhost:9000
@apiKey = your-api-key-here

### Index new and changed files under a folder of the filing source
POST {{baseUrl}}/services/knowledge/api/sync
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
    "directory": "/"
}

### Status: counts, last sync, skipped files, ratings
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/knowledge/api/status
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Indexed files the caller may read
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/knowledge/api/sources
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Find the most relevant chunks
POST {{baseUrl}}/services/knowledge/api/retrieve
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
    "question": "How do I rotate the settings secret?",
    "k": 5
}

### Answer with citations
POST {{baseUrl}}/services/knowledge/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
    "question": "How do I rotate the settings secret?"
}

### Answer as it is written (server-sent events: sources, text..., done)
POST {{baseUrl}}/services/knowledge/api/ask/stream
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
    "question": "How do I rotate the settings secret?"
}

### Rate an answer
POST {{baseUrl}}/services/knowledge/api/feedback
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
    "question": "How do I rotate the settings secret?",
    "rating": "good",
    "citations": ["docs/settings.md"]
}

### List ratings (knowledge:write)
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/knowledge/api/feedback?rating=bad&limit=20
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Evaluate retrieval (and, with answers, citations) against labelled questions
POST {{baseUrl}}/services/knowledge/api/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
    "yaml": "- question: How do I rotate the settings secret?\n  expectedPath: docs/settings.md\n",
    "k": 5,
    "answers": false
}

### Evaluate with the answers rated good as the cases
POST {{baseUrl}}/services/knowledge/api/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
    "fromFeedback": true
}
